MitiruEngine v@PROJECT_VERSION@ — Portable Windows distribution
==============================================================

This zip contains a ready-to-run MitiruEngine install. No terminal required.

QUICK START
-----------

  1. Extract this zip to any folder (e.g. C:\Tools\MitiruEngine).
  2. Double-click `MitiruEngine_Launcher.bat`.
  3. The launcher window opens with a list of registered projects.
  4. Click "+ Add project (.dll)" to register a game DLL, or click Run / Watch
     on one of the bundled samples.

INCLUDED
--------

  - mitiru_host.exe       — the engine host that loads game DLLs
  - mitiru_launcher/      — GUI launcher (built with MitiruEngine itself!)
  - sample games          — welcome, shapes, text, input, and more
  - CEF runtime           — Chromium Embedded Framework for HTML/CSS UI
  - MitiruCefHelper.exe   — CEF subprocess helper (don't run directly)

WORKFLOW
--------

  1. Build your game DLL with the engine (see docs/GETTING_STARTED.md).
  2. From the launcher: + Add project → pick your_game.dll.
  3. Click "Run" — your game opens in its own window.
  4. Click "Watch" — your game opens AND auto-reloads when you rebuild the DLL.
     Edit code → rebuild → game state preserved, new code runs.

POWER USERS / CI
----------------

  Bypass the launcher and call mitiru_host directly:

    mitiru_host.exe path\to\your_game.dll              # plain run
    mitiru_host.exe path\to\your_game.dll --watch      # hot reload mode

REQUIREMENTS
------------

  - Windows 10/11 x64
  - DirectX 11 / 12 capable GPU (most integrated GPUs work)
  - No installation. No registry changes. Just extract and run.

DOCS
